<Page x:Class="WraithClient.Views.ProfileView"
      xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
      xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
      Background="Transparent"
      FontFamily="Segoe UI">

    <ScrollViewer Margin="24,20,24,20" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
        <StackPanel MaxWidth="540" HorizontalAlignment="Left">

            <TextBlock Text="Account"
                       Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}"
                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
            <TextBlock Text="Switch modes on the home screen."
                       Foreground="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}"
                       FontSize="12" Margin="0,0,0,20"/>

            <!-- Cracked username -->
            <TextBlock Text="CRACKED USERNAME" Style="{StaticResource Label}" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>
            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="20" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="The name shown in-game when playing in cracked mode."
                               Foreground="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}"
                               FontSize="12" Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <TextBox x:Name="UsernameBox" Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource TextBox}"/>
                        <Button Grid.Column="2"
                                Content="Save"
                                Style="{StaticResource PrimaryBtn}"
                                Height="36" Padding="16,0"
                                Click="SaveUsername_Click"/>
                    </Grid>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="UsernameStatus"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}"
                               FontSize="11" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!-- Premium info -->
            <TextBlock Text="PREMIUM" Style="{StaticResource Label}" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>
            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="20">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" FontSize="12"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" LineHeight="20">
Premium mode works like <Run Foreground="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold">Forge</Run> — Wraith injects the mod into your&#x0a;<Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}">.minecraft\mods</Run> folder, then opens the official Minecraft Launcher.&#x0a;&#x0a;Sign in there as normal. No credentials are handled by Wraith.&#x0a;&#x0a;Make sure you have <Run Foreground="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold">Fabric Loader</Run> installed via fabricmc.net for the&#x0a;version you want to play with the mod.
                    </TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

        </StackPanel>
    </ScrollViewer>
</Page>
